# Architecture setup
- Use feature-based architecture.
- Keep business logic out of React components.
- Keep business logic out of route handlers.
- Use service layer for workflows/business rules.
- Use repository layer for Prisma access.
- Shared reusable code belongs in /components, /lib, /server.
- Feature-specific code belongs inside /features.

# Anti-Patterns

Do not:
- create giant files
- inline AI prompts
- duplicate validation schemas
- Prefer simple implementations over premature abstractions

